&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of owning and shipping complex, production-grade systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience shipping and maintaining AI-native products or features, or demonstrable passion through significant personal projects in AI&lt;/li&gt;
